{"3902930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pogo Panic", "steam_appid": 3902930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Now with Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the madness <strong>together</strong>. Team up for co-op chaos, recover from disasters, and turn every miraculous save into a shared victory scream. It is the same brutal climb, just louder with friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/1614e8c3a1235d18620396884ad26977.poster.avif?t=1783343022\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/1614e8c3a1235d18620396884ad26977.webm?t=1783343022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/1614e8c3a1235d18620396884ad26977.mp4?t=1783343022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pogo Physics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Momentum</strong> - Every jab of the spring obeys real-world inertia (kinda). Miss the angle and you will ricochet straight back to pavement.[]<strong>No Checkpoints</strong> - One slip, restart. Skill or sheer stubbornness is all that keeps you going.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tilt, Snap, Shatter</strong> - Platforms sway, crumble, or launch you skyward like a catapult. Every surface becomes a fresh launchpad for your next leap.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/b98f6257ef4dc2f1099144368d4a5fc6.poster.avif?t=1783343022\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/b98f6257ef4dc2f1099144368d4a5fc6.webm?t=1783343022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/b98f6257ef4dc2f1099144368d4a5fc6.mp4?t=1783343022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Jet Jitters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Micro Thruster</strong> - A jury-rigged jetpack gives a heartbeat of thrust, just enough to rescue you or send you spiraling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fuel on Fumes</strong> - The tank empties in seconds. Refills are scarce and never convenient.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last-Chance Heroics</strong> - Fire the thruster at the perfect millisecond to salvage free-fall panic or stretch your flight by a few humbling meters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/35751bc7605afb6fa8f83da7c8d047d5.poster.avif?t=1783343022\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/35751bc7605afb6fa8f83da7c8d047d5.webm?t=1783343022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/35751bc7605afb6fa8f83da7c8d047d5.mp4?t=1783343022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Obstacles With Issues</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge moving walls that track your hops, swinging wrecking hammers, cannons that treat you like target practice. Everything here craves a cardboard casserole. Outsmart them or taste defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/7ba9b64a1317f307bef55d6c5eac8ca5.poster.avif?t=1783343022\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/7ba9b64a1317f307bef55d6c5eac8ca5.webm?t=1783343022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/7ba9b64a1317f307bef55d6c5eac8ca5.mp4?t=1783343022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pogo a cardboard man through madness, blast that jetpack on fumes, and punch gravity where it hurts. Suit up - cereal boxes and all. Go solo or bring friends for multiplayer climbing chaos. See you at the summit... if the duct tape holds.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Now with Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the madness <strong>together</strong>. Team up for co-op chaos, recover from disasters, and turn every miraculous save into a shared victory scream. It is the same brutal climb, just louder with friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/1614e8c3a1235d18620396884ad26977.poster.avif?t=1783343022\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/1614e8c3a1235d18620396884ad26977.webm?t=1783343022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/1614e8c3a1235d18620396884ad26977.mp4?t=1783343022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pogo Physics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Momentum</strong> - Every jab of the spring obeys real-world inertia (kinda). Miss the angle and you will ricochet straight back to pavement.[]<strong>No Checkpoints</strong> - One slip, restart. Skill or sheer stubbornness is all that keeps you going.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tilt, Snap, Shatter</strong> - Platforms sway, crumble, or launch you skyward like a catapult. Every surface becomes a fresh launchpad for your next leap.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/b98f6257ef4dc2f1099144368d4a5fc6.poster.avif?t=1783343022\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/b98f6257ef4dc2f1099144368d4a5fc6.webm?t=1783343022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/b98f6257ef4dc2f1099144368d4a5fc6.mp4?t=1783343022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Jet Jitters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Micro Thruster</strong> - A jury-rigged jetpack gives a heartbeat of thrust, just enough to rescue you or send you spiraling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fuel on Fumes</strong> - The tank empties in seconds. Refills are scarce and never convenient.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last-Chance Heroics</strong> - Fire the thruster at the perfect millisecond to salvage free-fall panic or stretch your flight by a few humbling meters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/35751bc7605afb6fa8f83da7c8d047d5.poster.avif?t=1783343022\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/35751bc7605afb6fa8f83da7c8d047d5.webm?t=1783343022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/35751bc7605afb6fa8f83da7c8d047d5.mp4?t=1783343022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Obstacles With Issues</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge moving walls that track your hops, swinging wrecking hammers, cannons that treat you like target practice. Everything here craves a cardboard casserole. Outsmart them or taste defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/7ba9b64a1317f307bef55d6c5eac8ca5.poster.avif?t=1783343022\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/7ba9b64a1317f307bef55d6c5eac8ca5.webm?t=1783343022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/extras/7ba9b64a1317f307bef55d6c5eac8ca5.mp4?t=1783343022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pogo a cardboard man through madness, blast that jetpack on fumes, and punch gravity where it hurts. Suit up - cereal boxes and all. Go solo or bring friends for multiplayer climbing chaos. See you at the summit... if the duct tape holds.</p>", "short_description": "Pogo Panic is a punishing parkour climb where you can play solo or co-op. Bounce on a pogo stick, burst a fleeting jetpack, and fight gravity through vertical sky courses with optional checkpoints. Turn them off for a full no mercy run.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902930/7a4394cb6d68802060b1c4860c2f3be3c7855359/header.jpg?t=1783343022", "capsule_image": "https